        {
          "text": "nya ndra oni Herimonia, Saleka pie, Basani dria pie, kpere esele ’ba Gesurini pini ’ba Maakatini beria, nya vini angu ali Gileadini, esele erini Sihoni opi Hesiboniari be. ",
