          "text": "Opi angu ndeni, Yosua pini ofule anzi Israelini be Yoridani ma kala etuni ’derialeroria, engazu Baali-gadi a’bu Lebanoniniariasi kpere ecazu oni Halaki geri tupi Seiriaria ’diyi yi ’di (Yosua fe angu nde suru Israelini ’diyi dri awitaru esele yini awale ri vusi, ",
